From: NovaRocks fixture maintainers
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Include storage-table in view version equivalence

Base-Commit: ccb8bc435062171e64bc8b7e5f56e6aed9c5b934
Contract: https://github.com/apache/iceberg/blob/f14886bb4c54d3e292df85161a0250fbb9ae6d12/format/view-spec.md

Local contract correction: changing only the storage-table pointer changes view semantics.
The PoC omits this field from sameViewVersion; retain both pointer versions.

